# ==================================
# Generated artifacts & datasets
# Keep the directory STRUCTURE (via .gitkeep) but never upload actual files
# (trained models, generated data, checkpoints, raw dataset, parquet cache).
# They are large and fully reproducible from the scripts.
# ==================================
data/**
outputs/**
outputs/models_pre_calibration/
# Re-include directories and placeholder files so the empty tree is tracked
!data/**/
!outputs/**/
!**/.gitkeep

